  // scripts/hooks-install.ts
  "Aguardando resposta no Claubbo": "Waiting for an answer in Claubbo",
  "Uso: npm run hooks:<install|uninstall|status> [-- op\xE7\xF5es]\n\n  install     acrescenta o hook de permiss\xE3o do Claubbo em cada conta (faz backup do settings.json)\n  uninstall   tira o hook do Claubbo de cada conta (os outros hooks ficam)\n  status      mostra se o hook est\xE1 instalado e se o Claubbo est\xE1 respondendo pedidos\n\nOp\xE7\xF5es:\n  --dry-run        mostra o que mudaria, sem gravar nada\n  --node <cmd>     comando do node usado no hook (padr\xE3o: detectado no PATH)\n  --port <n>       porta do Claubbo (padr\xE3o: CLAUBBO_PORT ou {0})\n  --timeout <s>    quanto o hook espera sua resposta no Claubbo antes de devolver o pedido ao terminal\n                   (padr\xE3o: {1} s)\n  -h, --help       mostra esta ajuda\n\nContas: as mesmas do servidor (~/.claude* com projects/ ou sessions/, CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR ou\nCLAUBBO_CLAUDE_DIRS).": "Usage: npm run hooks:<install|uninstall|status> [-- options]\n\n  install     adds the Claubbo permission hook to each account (backs up settings.json)\n  uninstall   removes the Claubbo hook from each account (other hooks stay)\n  status      shows whether the hook is installed and whether Claubbo is handling requests\n\nOptions:\n  --dry-run        shows what would change, without writing anything\n  --node <cmd>     node command used in the hook (default: detected in PATH)\n  --port <n>       Claubbo port (default: CLAUBBO_PORT or {0})\n  --timeout <s>    how long the hook waits for your answer in Claubbo before handing the request back to the terminal\n                   (default: {1} s)\n  -h, --help       shows this help\n\nAccounts: the same as the server's (~/.claude* with projects/ or sessions/, CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR or\nCLAUBBO_CLAUDE_DIRS).",
  "atualizado (novo caminho do Claubbo, do node ou das op\xE7\xF5es)": "updated (new Claubbo path, node path or options)",
  "instalado": "installed",
  "hook do Claubbo removido": "Claubbo hook removed",
  "--node precisa de um caminho.": "--node needs a path.",
  "Nenhuma conta do Claude Code encontrada (~/.claude* com projects/ ou sessions/). Use CLAUBBO_CLAUDE_DIRS se estiverem em outro lugar.": "No Claude Code account found (~/.claude* with projects/ or sessions/). Use CLAUBBO_CLAUDE_DIRS if they're somewhere else.",
  " (esse arquivo n\xE3o existe mais: o hook falha e vale s\xF3 o terminal)": " (that file no longer exists: the hook fails and only the terminal counts)",
  "! {0}: o hook aponta para {1}{2}; rode npm run hooks:install para atualizar": "! {0}: the hook points to {1}{2}; run npm run hooks:install to update",
  "\u2022 {0}: instalado ({1}; tempo limite {2} s)": "\u2022 {0}: installed ({1}; timeout {2} s)",
  "Claubbo em http://127.0.0.1:{0}: fora do ar (com ele parado, o hook sai na hora e o terminal segue normal).": "Claubbo at http://127.0.0.1:{0}: down (while it's stopped, the hook exits right away and the terminal works as usual).",
  "Claubbo em http://127.0.0.1:{0}: respondendo pedidos de permiss\xE3o (com alguma p\xE1gina aberta).": "Claubbo at http://127.0.0.1:{0}: handling permission requests (with a page open).",
  "Claubbo em http://127.0.0.1:{0}: no ar, mas responder pelo escrit\xF3rio est\xE1 desligado (porta exposta na rede ou CLAUBBO_TERMINAL=0).": "Claubbo at http://127.0.0.1:{0}: up, but answering from the office is off (port exposed on the network or CLAUBBO_TERMINAL=0).",
  "Pronto. Com o Claubbo aberto no navegador, os pedidos de permiss\xE3o aparecem no escrit\xF3rio e voc\xEA": "Done. With Claubbo open in the browser, permission requests show up in the office and you",
  "pode aprovar ou recusar por l\xE1; o di\xE1logo continua no terminal e vale o que responder primeiro.": "can approve or deny them there; the dialog stays in the terminal and whichever answer comes first wins.",
  "Sess\xF5es abertas costumam recarregar o settings.json sozinhas; se n\xE3o, reabra a sess\xE3o.": "Open sessions usually reload settings.json on their own; if not, reopen the session.",
  "Para desfazer: npm run hooks:uninstall": "To undo: npm run hooks:uninstall",
  "[hooks] Erro: {0}": "[hooks] Error: {0}",
  "[hooks] Erro inesperado: {0}": "[hooks] Unexpected error: {0}",
  // scripts/mod-install.ts
  "Uso: npm run mod:<install|uninstall|status> [-- op\xE7\xF5es]\n\n  install     instala o mod do Claubbo no Claude Code de cada conta (marketplace desta pasta + plugins)\n              e tira o que ele substitui: o tap de statusline e o hook de permiss\xE3o antigos e o mod do\n              nome antigo (codetown)\n  uninstall   tira os plugins e o marketplace do Claubbo de cada conta (e os do nome antigo, se sobraram)\n  status      mostra, por conta, o marketplace, os plugins (e vers\xF5es) e o que sobrou do jeito antigo\n\nOp\xE7\xF5es:\n  --sem-permissoes   n\xE3o instala o plugin de responder permiss\xF5es pelo escrit\xF3rio (e mant\xE9m o hook antigo)\n  --sem-mensagens    n\xE3o instala o plugin de mandar mensagens pelo escrit\xF3rio (um j\xE1 instalado continua)\n  --conta <pasta>    s\xF3 esta conta (ex.: --conta ~/.claude-conta2); pode repetir\n  --dry-run          mostra o que faria, sem instalar nem gravar nada\n  --claude <cmd>     comando do Claude Code (padr\xE3o: claude, do PATH)\n  -h, --help         mostra esta ajuda\n\nPrecisa do Claude Code {0} ou mais novo. Em vers\xF5es anteriores, use o jeito antigo:\nnpm run usage:install (uso ao vivo) e npm run hooks:install (responder permiss\xF5es); mandar mensagens pelo\nescrit\xF3rio s\xF3 existe com o mod.\n\nContas: as mesmas do servidor (~/.claude* com projects/ ou sessions/, CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR ou\nCLAUBBO_CLAUDE_DIRS). Uso capturado em CLAUBBO_USAGE_DIR (padr\xE3o ~/.claubbo/usage).": "Usage: npm run mod:<install|uninstall|status> [-- options]\n\n  install     installs the Claubbo mod into each account's Claude Code (this folder's marketplace + plugins)\n              and removes what it replaces: the old statusline tap, the old permission hook and the mod under\n              the old name (codetown)\n  uninstall   removes the Claubbo plugins and marketplace from each account (and the old-name ones, if any are left)\n  status      shows, per account, the marketplace, the plugins (and versions) and what's left of the old way\n\nOptions:\n  --sem-permissoes   doesn't install the plugin for answering permissions from the office (and keeps the old hook)\n  --sem-mensagens    doesn't install the plugin for sending messages from the office (one already installed stays)\n  --conta <folder>   only this account (e.g. --conta ~/.claude-conta2); can be repeated\n  --dry-run          shows what it would do, without installing or writing anything\n  --claude <cmd>     Claude Code command (default: claude, from PATH)\n  -h, --help         shows this help\n\nRequires Claude Code {0} or newer. On earlier versions, use the old way:\nnpm run usage:install (live usage) and npm run hooks:install (answer permissions); sending messages from the\noffice only exists with the mod.\n\nAccounts: the same as the server's (~/.claude* with projects/ or sessions/, CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR or\nCLAUBBO_CLAUDE_DIRS). Usage captured in CLAUBBO_USAGE_DIR (default ~/.claubbo/usage).",
