  "Uso: npm run usage:<install|uninstall|status> [-- op\xE7\xF5es]\n\n  install     envolve o statusline de cada conta com o tap do Claubbo (faz backup do settings.json)\n  uninstall   restaura o statusline original de cada conta\n  status      mostra se o tap est\xE1 instalado e quando chegou o \xFAltimo uso de cada conta\n\nOp\xE7\xF5es:\n  --dry-run        mostra o que mudaria, sem gravar nada\n  --node <cmd>     comando do node usado no statusline (padr\xE3o: detectado no PATH)\n  -h, --help       mostra esta ajuda\n\nContas: as mesmas do servidor (~/.claude* com projects/ ou sessions/, CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR ou\nCLAUBBO_CLAUDE_DIRS). Uso capturado em CLAUBBO_USAGE_DIR (padr\xE3o ~/.claubbo/usage).": "Usage: npm run usage:<install|uninstall|status> [-- options]\n\n  install     wraps each account's statusline with the Claubbo tap (backs up settings.json)\n  uninstall   restores each account's original statusline\n  status      shows whether the tap is installed and when each account's last usage arrived\n\nOptions:\n  --dry-run        shows what would change, without writing anything\n  --node <cmd>     node command used in the statusline (default: detected in PATH)\n  -h, --help       shows this help\n\nAccounts: the same as the server's (~/.claude* with projects/ or sessions/, CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR or\nCLAUBBO_CLAUDE_DIRS). Usage captured in CLAUBBO_USAGE_DIR (default ~/.claubbo/usage).",
