  "Claubbo World: desligado ({0}).": "Claubbo World: off ({0}).",
  "A conta do Claubbo World foi exclu\xEDda. O pr\xE9dio e o perfil sa\xEDram do mundo na hora; o resto \xE9 apagado do banco em 7 dias e dos backups em at\xE9 30.": "The Claubbo World account was deleted. The building and the profile left the world right away; the rest is deleted from the database within 7 days and from backups within 30.",
