  "Para voltar ao jeito antigo (Claude Code anterior ao 2.1.287): npm run usage:install e npm run hooks:install": "Para volver al m\xE9todo antiguo (Claude Code anterior a 2.1.287): npm run usage:install y npm run hooks:install",
