  "Para voltar ao jeito antigo (Claude Code anterior ao 2.1.287): npm run usage:install e npm run hooks:install": "Pour revenir \xE0 l'ancienne m\xE9thode (Claude Code ant\xE9rieur \xE0 2.1.287)\xA0: npm run usage:install et npm run hooks:install",
